The cosine kernel's x/4 term retains 11 fraction bits as an empirical
modification inferred from MATLAB recordings, not from these sources.
Arguments beyond the medium-reduction range use the attributed double
matlab_math routines rounded to single instead of __kernel_rem_pio2f.
Inf and NaN return a NaN constant; sign and payload are not preserved.

